Command-line equivalent of the existing per-engagement "Delete client"
UI action, for clearing out test/scratch engagements in bulk before
running the workspace split. Same soft-delete semantics as the DELETE
/api/engagements/[id] route (sets deletedAt + pausedAt, never a hard
delete) — dry-run by default, --yes required to actually write.

